Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_ItsYouLetsSailToDewford:
	.string "Hm? It's {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "You saved my darling PEEKO!\p"
	.string "Want to see a TOP G video first?\n"
	.string "No? Pushups, then? Kickboxing?\p"
	.string "What's that? You want to sail with me?\n"
	.string "To DEWFORD and SLATEPORT?\p"
	.string "Look. I don't have a BUGATTI.\p"
	.string "But I've got this small boat.\p"
	.string "It'll be a YACHT one day. Once I\n"
	.string "finish my CYBERSECURITY degree.\p"
	.string "We'll set sail for DEWFORD!$"

Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_SetSailForDewford:
	.string "IZZO: DEWFORD it is, then!\p"
	.string "Anchors aweigh! PEEKO, ten pushups\n"
	.string "before we land!$"

Route104_MrBrineysHouse_Text_WhereAreWeBound:
	.string "IZZO: Ahoy! For you, I'll take the\n"
	.string "small boat out anytime!\p"
	.string "Now, where are we bound?$"

